             For audio: bg=TRANSPARENT → layers above show through. Seekbar always on top. -->
        <!-- S1007: not D-pad/keyboard focusable - the video surface itself must never wear the app-wide
             TV focus decoration (core/ui/focus/FocusDecorationController); only real controls should. -->
